'''Blood''' is a [[Vintage Weapons|vintage]] knife originally purchasable from the shop in [[Murder Mystery|Murder Mystery 1]] for 4000 Points {{Currency|Point}} or 175 Cash {{Currency|Cash}}. It can now only be obtained through trading. 

== Appearance ==
Blood has a gradient from a bright red to a dark red as its blade with a white line intersecting the middle. It also has a red dragon with black horns as the guard with a crimson red handle. It also has a circle piece with a bright red skull on the bottom of the handle.

== Trivia ==
* Blood's model is based off [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/51757162/Korblox-Berserkers-Claymore Korblox: Berserker's Claymore] except it was rescaled and was retextured into red.
* Blood used to increase your walking speed by 50% when you melee kill someone in [[Murder Mystery|Murder Mystery 1]], similar to the [[Sprint]] [[Powers|power]].
* Blood was the most expensive knife during [[Murder Mystery|Murder Mystery 1]].
* Blood is currently the second smallest [[Knives|knife]] in the game. The first being [[Ghost]].
* Blood is one of the ten weapons in the [[Murder Mystery 2 Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Vintage Set|Vintage Set]], the others being: [[Shadow]], [[Phaser]], [[Golden]], [[America (Vintage)|America]], [[Splitter]], [[Laser (Vintage)|Laser]], [[Prince]], and [[Cowboy]]

